WEBVTT

00:00:53.321 --> 00:00:57.690
Arusu was told by Lennon that
they're mirrors of each other.

00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:01.558
So Arusu wants to find out
who Lennon really is.

00:01:02.464 --> 00:01:07.026
Plus Sheila is busy trying to find
the traitor among the witches.

00:01:07.135 --> 00:01:10.765
And Eva got mad since
she was left all alone.

00:01:11.373 --> 00:01:14.399
Meanwhile, Sigma was being
held captive by the warlocks...

00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:17.274
...and he meets a man named Jidan.

00:01:18.146 --> 00:01:20.513
Could he possibly be...

00:02:48.503 --> 00:02:51.871
Tweeny Witches

00:02:56.378 --> 00:03:00.838
Destruction Foreshadowed

00:03:07.789 --> 00:03:10.520
You lied to me when
you said you hate magic.

00:03:10.825 --> 00:03:14.523
| mean if you had, then you
wouldn't be treasuring that book.

00:03:17.632 --> 00:03:19.122
Am I right?

00:03:19.401 --> 00:03:20.077
You're wrong.

00:03:20.101 --> 00:03:22.934
You're wrong.
Usually, my intuition is right.

00:03:23.171 --> 00:03:24.570
It's not like that.

00:03:24.973 --> 00:03:26.338
Then what's it like?

00:03:26.775 --> 00:03:27.799
Well...

00:03:30.178 --> 00:03:32.613
Don't bone in and
spoil our conversation!

00:03:32.914 --> 00:03:35.212
You mean butt in on your conversation!

00:03:38.953 --> 00:03:40.297
The True Book of Spells...

00:03:40.321 --> 00:03:40.913
The True Book of Spells...
Huh?

00:03:42.057 --> 00:03:42.922
They took it.

00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:55.460
Grandma! I can't believe
the warlocks are here!

00:03:56.504 --> 00:03:58.598
Hey! Grandma?

00:04:14.422 --> 00:04:16.618
They don't know anything.

00:04:18.493 --> 00:04:19.654
Credelle?

00:04:19.794 --> 00:04:21.353
Is everything okay?

00:04:21.563 --> 00:04:25.022
Soon, everyone will lose
their power and collapse.

00:04:34.709 --> 00:04:36.234
Come on, pan yon.

00:04:36.344 --> 00:04:40.042
| just want you to give me a
tiny piece of that beard. Okay?

00:04:43.785 --> 00:04:49.315
| just want to show others
that I can do things on my own!

00:04:50.692 --> 00:04:51.591
Eva!

00:04:54.496 --> 00:04:56.123
What should I do?

00:04:56.331 --> 00:04:57.007
They took it?

00:04:57.031 --> 00:04:57.998
They took it?
Well, you see...

00:04:58.099 --> 00:05:01.592
...we were taken by surprise,
and they snatched the book.

00:05:01.703 --> 00:05:04.866
They came from above
like this and snatched it.

00:05:04.973 --> 00:05:06.236
It was the warlocks.

00:05:06.341 --> 00:05:08.537
Well, something like that.

00:05:08.943 --> 00:05:10.308
What about the safe dog?

00:05:10.411 --> 00:05:11.276
Safe dog?

00:05:11.713 --> 00:05:14.182
No, the safe dog is right there.

00:05:16.951 --> 00:05:19.818
Did you take out the
True Book of Spells?

00:05:20.121 --> 00:05:22.317
Well, you see, Sheila...

00:05:22.423 --> 00:05:26.587
It's true that Lennon tried
to take the safe dog, but...

00:05:26.694 --> 00:05:30.153
...it seems like there was
some reason for doing that.

00:05:30.265 --> 00:05:32.324
Let's settle this peacefully.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.332
| knew that would happen.

00:05:38.072 --> 00:05:40.404
No way! What's going on?

00:05:40.508 --> 00:05:44.138
This is the real book.
The one they took was a fake.

00:05:44.345 --> 00:05:48.009
| thought something like this might
happen, so I prepared it beforehand.

00:05:48.116 --> 00:05:50.380
Oh, Sheila!

00:05:50.485 --> 00:05:53.079
You're like a magician,
even though you're a witch!

00:05:53.188 --> 00:05:56.556
This isn't just an ordinary safe.
It's a magical guard dog.

00:05:56.658 --> 00:05:58.558
You just hid it well in the back.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.150
Did you say something?

00:06:00.261 --> 00:06:01.160
Nothing.

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:05.125
| can't believe you got a fake!

00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:07.291
Those little rascals!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:13.940
But now we know that
they have the True Book of Spells.

00:06:14.342 --> 00:06:15.969
Yes, indeed.

00:06:16.578 --> 00:06:19.946
How are we doing with
the capturing of the fairies?

00:06:20.114 --> 00:06:24.449
Out of 100 species,
we currently have 47.

00:06:25.186 --> 00:06:26.210
Tiana.

00:06:26.454 --> 00:06:27.148
Yes!

00:06:27.789 --> 00:06:31.987
And to the great men of our army.

00:06:32.193 --> 00:06:33.092
Yes!

00:06:34.863 --> 00:06:37.457
The time of destruction is upon us.

00:06:38.199 --> 00:06:41.362
There is only one thing
left for us to do.

00:06:41.636 --> 00:06:45.732
The creation of a new realm
by the use of dark magic.

00:06:47.108 --> 00:06:49.008
Attention, all units!

00:06:49.143 --> 00:06:53.046
Gather all your strength and
capture the remaining fairies.

00:06:53.214 --> 00:06:56.206
And bring me the True Book of Spells!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.280
But now we know the
pirate's been planning...

00:07:01.389 --> 00:07:03.858
...to do something using this book.

00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:06.757
Sheila. You're just thinking too hard.

00:07:06.861 --> 00:07:08.693
What are you trying to do?

00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:12.566
Eva! And Qoo?

00:07:13.434 --> 00:07:14.128
Hey!

00:07:14.269 --> 00:07:15.566
What's wrong?

00:07:15.803 --> 00:07:17.396
Well, you see...

00:07:20.508 --> 00:07:23.034
Can't you do anything with magic?

00:07:24.479 --> 00:07:26.641
That's why I got the spell book.
Let's see...

00:07:26.748 --> 00:07:29.183
Heal... recovery... um...

00:07:29.284 --> 00:07:29.927
It's impossible.

00:07:29.951 --> 00:07:30.474
It's impossible.
What?

00:07:30.585 --> 00:07:31.518
Impossible?

00:07:31.753 --> 00:07:34.154
Then what good is magic?

00:07:34.289 --> 00:07:36.781
Yeah. Why do you say such a thing?

00:07:36.891 --> 00:07:39.417
You're the one who said
to never give up.

00:07:39.527 --> 00:07:41.655
I'm able to use magic now.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:44.956
| couldn't do anything before,
but now I'm trying to make up for it!

00:07:45.066 --> 00:07:47.535
So why are you being pessimistic?

00:07:47.635 --> 00:07:50.104
We can't do anything with magic.

00:07:50.238 --> 00:07:50.932
What?

00:07:51.439 --> 00:07:52.783
I'm telling you. I's impossible.

00:07:52.807 --> 00:07:54.036
I'm telling you. I's impossible.
It can't be...

00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:55.903
It's not like she's sick.

00:07:57.045 --> 00:07:58.911
| need to talk to you, Sheila.

00:08:03.751 --> 00:08:04.513
Yeah.

00:08:04.886 --> 00:08:08.117
Qoo's grandmother isn't
the only one who collapsed.

00:08:10.358 --> 00:08:11.883
Then that means...

00:08:15.797 --> 00:08:18.562
It's because the
magic is getting weaker.

00:08:20.134 --> 00:08:23.934
Our source of magic comes from
the light of the Sanctuary...

00:08:24.072 --> 00:08:26.507
...and it is about to fade.

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:30.835
Wait a minute, Atelia.

00:08:30.945 --> 00:08:33.676
When you say the
light of the Sanctuary...

00:08:36.017 --> 00:08:37.644
Let's do it, Eva!

00:08:37.752 --> 00:08:38.241
What?

00:08:38.586 --> 00:08:42.284
The healing spell and the magical
medicine... Let's try everything!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.884
Everything that's written in here.

00:08:44.993 --> 00:08:46.070
Arusu!

00:08:46.094 --> 00:08:46.403
Arusu!
But that book is...

00:08:46.427 --> 00:08:47.758
But that book is...

00:08:47.895 --> 00:08:50.762
If we don't use it now,
then when are we gonna use it?

00:08:50.865 --> 00:08:53.698
It's magic. Nothing is impossible.

00:08:55.169 --> 00:08:56.295
Let's go, Qoo!

00:08:56.404 --> 00:08:56.996
Okay!

00:08:57.171 --> 00:08:58.400
Let's go, Arusu!

00:08:58.506 --> 00:08:59.473
Of course!

00:09:05.346 --> 00:09:06.905
What magic?

00:09:07.015 --> 00:09:08.949
It's no use giving them hope.

00:09:10.018 --> 00:09:11.452
Don't say that!

00:09:11.586 --> 00:09:13.782
But you feel that way too, right?

00:09:15.223 --> 00:09:17.123
Don't speak ill of magic!

00:09:17.392 --> 00:09:18.086
Hey!

00:09:19.293 --> 00:09:20.471
I'll negotiate with the top.

00:09:20.495 --> 00:09:21.257
I'll negotiate with the top.
Top?

00:09:21.662 --> 00:09:23.596
I'm going to see Atelia.

00:09:24.198 --> 00:09:25.427
Atelia...

00:09:26.467 --> 00:09:28.492
What are you planning to do?

00:09:28.803 --> 00:09:33.172
Grand master, Presatio, Credelle...

00:09:33.408 --> 00:09:37.470
Even the normal witches are
beginning to collapse as well.

00:09:37.612 --> 00:09:38.875
| realize that.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:39.913
Then why?

00:09:40.415 --> 00:09:42.645
And what do you want me to do about it?

00:09:43.184 --> 00:09:47.314
You don't care if others are
collapsing one after another?

00:09:47.889 --> 00:09:50.722
Will it make a difference
if I told them the truth?

00:09:51.192 --> 00:09:52.921
There's nothing we can do.

00:09:52.994 --> 00:09:57.454
And if we tell them the truth, then it
will only create unrest and confusion.

00:09:57.765 --> 00:09:59.028
But that's...

00:09:59.467 --> 00:10:01.902
I'm sure no one wants to hear that...

00:10:02.003 --> 00:10:05.200
...the Magical Realm is
about to be destroyed.

00:10:05.506 --> 00:10:08.203
But they have the right to know!

00:10:08.643 --> 00:10:12.170
Yes, and I have a responsibility
to tell them the truth.

00:10:13.181 --> 00:10:16.207
But I don't think
| can calm them down...

00:10:17.118 --> 00:10:18.950
I'm scared myself.

00:10:19.053 --> 00:10:20.987
| can't believe I'm a leader.

00:10:23.758 --> 00:10:24.486
Her...

00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:25.490
Her?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:31.257
No... I was just wondering what
Arusu would do in this type of situation.

00:10:31.432 --> 00:10:32.797
Oops-a-daisy.

00:10:33.067 --> 00:10:33.829
There!

00:10:36.737 --> 00:10:37.848
Eva! Next!

00:10:37.872 --> 00:10:38.600
Eva! Next!
Okay.

00:10:39.907 --> 00:10:40.931
Arusu...

00:10:41.042 --> 00:10:42.874
| can keep going. Can you get that?

00:10:45.246 --> 00:10:46.680
Grand Master.

00:10:46.914 --> 00:10:48.814
What should I do?

00:10:57.125 --> 00:10:58.456
What's going on?

00:10:58.526 --> 00:10:59.288
Atelia!

00:10:59.427 --> 00:11:00.451
The people!

00:11:03.965 --> 00:11:04.523
Stop!

00:11:04.932 --> 00:11:06.661
Stop! Stop it!

00:11:09.203 --> 00:11:10.898
| have no choice.

00:11:11.172 --> 00:11:15.370
Tell everyone to go to the chapel.

00:11:34.395 --> 00:11:37.387
Tweeny Witches

00:11:41.936 --> 00:11:46.396
<i>Full-scale Attack</i>

00:11:49.944 --> 00:11:51.639
How are the people?

00:11:52.613 --> 00:11:55.105
At first, I thought
it would turn into total chaos.

00:11:55.216 --> 00:11:58.049
But it seems like
they all went to the chapel.

00:11:58.319 --> 00:11:59.115
| see...

00:11:59.387 --> 00:12:00.354
But...

00:12:00.588 --> 00:12:02.955
How do you explain
this situation to them?

00:12:03.057 --> 00:12:04.923
| won't explain it to them.

00:12:04.992 --> 00:12:05.584
Huh?

00:12:06.761 --> 00:12:10.095
| just have to turn their fear
to something else.

00:12:10.698 --> 00:12:12.928
That's the important thing.

00:12:15.736 --> 00:12:16.380
This way?

00:12:16.404 --> 00:12:18.736
This way?
Do whatever you can to find them!

00:12:19.073 --> 00:12:20.632
They're not here!

00:12:20.841 --> 00:12:22.002
Not here either!

00:12:22.109 --> 00:12:24.407
I don't care.
Launch a full-scale attack!

00:12:29.684 --> 00:12:31.709
Let's see, the next one is...

00:12:33.888 --> 00:12:36.118
Qoo. I'm sorry...

00:12:37.058 --> 00:12:38.184
Grandma.

00:12:38.292 --> 00:12:40.158
Grandma, please believe in the magic.

00:12:40.261 --> 00:12:42.286
That's right. You have to believe.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.899
If your heart believes,
then it will work.

00:12:53.708 --> 00:12:54.903
Sheila!

00:12:55.509 --> 00:12:57.603
Everyone! Head to the chapel right now!

00:12:57.712 --> 00:12:58.440
Chapel?

00:12:58.713 --> 00:13:02.308
Atelia told the people to go there.
I'll explain things later!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.383
Hurry!

00:13:03.551 --> 00:13:05.383
But Qoo's grandma is...

00:13:05.453 --> 00:13:06.230
We'll take her with us!

00:13:06.254 --> 00:13:08.416
We'll take her with us!
But we can't possibly move her...

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:10.686
Sheila!

00:13:12.827 --> 00:13:14.693
The back! Go to the back!

00:13:14.762 --> 00:13:15.558
Okay!

00:13:17.231 --> 00:13:19.325
Don't let them get away!

00:13:28.843 --> 00:13:30.038
Quiet!

00:13:31.178 --> 00:13:34.773
The Magical Realm is
on the verge of a crisis.

00:13:35.983 --> 00:13:38.850
The decreasing sources
of power used for magic.

00:13:39.353 --> 00:13:41.845
And the rare, unknown illness.

00:13:42.223 --> 00:13:43.782
Everything is...

00:13:44.392 --> 00:13:47.259
Everything is being done as they please.

00:13:48.229 --> 00:13:50.891
This is all because of the warlocks!

00:13:54.235 --> 00:13:55.464
Don't worry.

00:13:57.872 --> 00:13:59.067
What is this?

00:13:59.173 --> 00:14:00.470
What is going on?

00:14:00.574 --> 00:14:03.475
Looks like the warlocks
launched a full-scale attack.

00:14:03.577 --> 00:14:04.840
But why?

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.875
The True Book of Spells?

00:14:07.982 --> 00:14:10.110
They came here to get it for good.

00:14:11.118 --> 00:14:13.143
Before the Magical Realm is destroyed.

00:14:13.254 --> 00:14:16.087
They will use the forbidden
dark magic with the book and...

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.401
...the 100 species of fairies.

00:14:17.425 --> 00:14:19.450
...the 100 species of fairies.
Forbidden dark magic?

00:14:21.562 --> 00:14:24.862
It's a spell that destroys everything.
The magic of darkness.

00:14:24.999 --> 00:14:26.296
Magic of darkness?

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.702
| stand here and...

00:14:34.241 --> 00:14:38.644
The Witch Realm is going to a
full-scale war with the warlocks!

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:47.419
Tiana.

00:14:47.655 --> 00:14:51.319
The C group just informed me that all
the witches are attending a meeting.

00:14:51.425 --> 00:14:54.690
We just received word from F group.
Looks like they found the girls.

00:14:54.829 --> 00:14:57.230
They're heading towards
the meeting place as we speak.

00:14:57.331 --> 00:14:59.390
They'll be caught like rats in a trap.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.629
Attention, all units!
Head to the meeting place at once!

00:15:02.737 --> 00:15:03.704
Yes, sir!

00:15:04.138 --> 00:15:06.573
| mean, what's gonna happen?

00:15:07.575 --> 00:15:11.773
Hey, what's gonna happen with
the witches and the warlocks?

00:15:12.813 --> 00:15:13.939
Sheila?

00:15:14.181 --> 00:15:16.775
Atelia is probably going to...

00:15:17.385 --> 00:15:18.580
Probably...

00:15:38.639 --> 00:15:41.540
All right. Hurry up and
get inside the protective field!

00:15:41.642 --> 00:15:42.131
Okay!

00:15:42.243 --> 00:15:43.620
You can leave me here.

00:15:43.644 --> 00:15:44.611
You can leave me here.
What?

00:15:44.912 --> 00:15:45.936
Grandma?

00:15:46.147 --> 00:15:47.672
Hurry up and go.

00:15:47.782 --> 00:15:48.647
But...

00:15:50.484 --> 00:15:51.815
You see...

00:15:52.286 --> 00:15:57.622
I've lived to pass on our traditions
from one generation to the other.

00:15:57.992 --> 00:16:00.859
I'm a witch who loved magic.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.031
I'm leaving you people in charge.

00:16:05.599 --> 00:16:08.330
Okay! Then we'll be
in charge from now on!

00:16:11.305 --> 00:16:13.000
You people...

00:16:16.811 --> 00:16:17.903
Hang on.

00:16:21.382 --> 00:16:22.850
We must fight!

00:16:22.983 --> 00:16:26.681
We must fight to protect
our tradition and glory!

00:16:28.989 --> 00:16:32.289
Let there be glory for the Witch Realm!

00:16:32.393 --> 00:16:34.418
Let there be glory!

00:16:34.895 --> 00:16:37.091
That's Atelia?

00:16:39.533 --> 00:16:40.022
Hey!

00:16:40.367 --> 00:16:41.027
Arusu?

00:16:41.135 --> 00:16:42.534
What are you going to do?

00:16:45.506 --> 00:16:48.339
What do you think
will happen if we fight?

00:16:50.177 --> 00:16:53.078
What can we achieve by fighting?

00:16:53.547 --> 00:16:54.458
What is she saying?

00:16:54.482 --> 00:16:56.246
What is she saying?
This realm is...

00:16:56.617 --> 00:17:00.053
This Magical Realm might
be destroyed, you know!

00:17:00.154 --> 00:17:00.697
She said it!

00:17:00.721 --> 00:17:01.745
She said it!
I'm not responsible!

00:17:01.889 --> 00:17:02.432
She said it!

00:17:02.456 --> 00:17:03.821
She said it!
I'm not responsible!

00:17:04.425 --> 00:17:05.756
What are we gonna do?

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.191
Shut her up!

00:17:12.032 --> 00:17:14.592
This is no time to be fighting!

00:17:14.802 --> 00:17:16.566
Aren't we supposed to protect...

00:17:16.704 --> 00:17:19.833
...the Magical Realm by
working with the warlocks?

00:17:24.712 --> 00:17:25.907
Don't worry.

00:17:26.146 --> 00:17:29.343
I'm not scared.
There's no need to be scared.

00:17:29.617 --> 00:17:30.277
Yeah!

00:17:30.384 --> 00:17:31.351
Arusu!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.488
Because you see...

00:17:38.759 --> 00:17:41.854
We have magic on our side, you know!

00:17:44.031 --> 00:17:49.561
Magic... Magic is supposed
to create miracles!

00:17:53.407 --> 00:17:54.738
What is going on?

00:17:55.876 --> 00:17:56.820
It's the warlocks!

00:17:56.844 --> 00:17:59.108
It's the warlocks!
The warlocks are coming!

00:17:59.547 --> 00:18:04.041
Find the True Book of Spells!
Find those apprentice witches!

00:18:04.218 --> 00:18:04.878
Yes.

00:18:17.631 --> 00:18:20.123
Atelia! It's not safe here!

00:18:20.267 --> 00:18:21.826
Please evacuate now!

00:18:21.936 --> 00:18:22.801
Yes.

00:18:24.305 --> 00:18:25.568
Atelia?

00:18:30.778 --> 00:18:32.940
Hurry, Atelia!

00:18:38.218 --> 00:18:40.710
Atelia...

00:18:41.589 --> 00:18:44.581
Are you sure this is what you want?

00:18:46.594 --> 00:18:49.791
Don't you people like magic?

00:18:50.698 --> 00:18:54.328
Hurting others with the magic
that you truly love.

00:18:54.468 --> 00:18:56.527
Is this what you really want?

00:18:56.637 --> 00:18:59.334
Arusu! Evacuate to Dragon House!

00:18:59.673 --> 00:19:02.836
They're trying to get
the True Book of Spells!

00:19:02.977 --> 00:19:04.206
Over there!

00:19:04.578 --> 00:19:05.340
Okay!

00:19:05.613 --> 00:19:06.842
But...

00:19:07.214 --> 00:19:11.173
If that book gets into their hands,
it'll be even more devastating!

00:19:12.319 --> 00:19:16.779
You have to flee in order to
protect the True Book of Spells!

00:19:18.459 --> 00:19:20.518
| don't want to do that.

00:19:20.628 --> 00:19:21.891
Why you!

00:19:24.498 --> 00:19:26.865
Get back here! After her!

00:19:27.067 --> 00:19:28.057
I---

00:19:28.469 --> 00:19:29.595
I---

00:19:30.037 --> 00:19:35.134
| really don't want others to get
hurt by the magic that I truly love!

00:19:35.442 --> 00:19:36.375
Arusu!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:37.654
Arusu!

00:19:37.678 --> 00:19:38.702
Arusu!
Arusu!

00:19:38.812 --> 00:19:39.938
Look out!

00:19:43.951 --> 00:19:45.214
Grandma?

00:20:04.505 --> 00:20:06.530
It's because of this book...

00:20:08.175 --> 00:20:10.974
This is all because of this book!

00:20:18.786 --> 00:20:26.750
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:26.927 --> 00:20:34.927
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:44.170
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:45.379 --> 00:20:50.943
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:51.051 --> 00:20:55.318
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:56.056 --> 00:21:00.289
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:21:00.394 --> 00:21:04.991
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:05.199 --> 00:21:10.365
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:10.471 --> 00:21:13.532
Let's hope it does.

00:21:15.109 --> 00:21:19.603
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:19.713 --> 00:21:22.205
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:22.316 --> 00:21:30.316
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:31.525 --> 00:21:37.225
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:37.331 --> 00:21:41.529
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
